#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-editor-version.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Image Versioning Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-editor-version.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Non-Destructive Editing and Versioning gives you the freedom of editing your "
"images, trying out whatever you want without worrying that you might regret "
"later what you did. &digikam; takes care of the original and every important "
"intermediate step if you want."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-editor-version.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the checkbox at the top you can enable or disable Non-Destructive Editing "
"and Versioning."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-editor-version.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the first field you can choose the file format used for saving the "
"intermediate steps and the final result. Remember that JPEG - like in the "
"screenshot above - is a lossy format. So if you need to start over from an "
"intermediate step it wouldn't be really non-destructive. If you can afford "
"it in terms of space on the harddisk and loading/saving speed you better "
"choose a lossless format like PNG or PCF for instance. Please click the "
"information button on the right side for more detailed information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-editor-version.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the next field you can decide whether the editor will save changes "
"automatically on exit or should ask first."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-editor-version.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the third field you decide on which occasions you want the editor to save "
"intermediate steps. Please click the information button on the right side "
"for more detailed information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-editor-version.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the last field you can adjust whether you want only the last version to "
"be shown in the Image View (default, none of the boxes checked) or if you "
"also want to see icons of the original version and/or intermediate steps."
msgstr ""

